  "notes": "<p>This show marked the beginning of Phish&#39;s Baker&#39;s Dozen run at Madison Square Garden and consisted of a Coconut donut theme. Coconut donuts were given to fans arriving at the venue and the show featured the Phish debuts of&nbsp;Shake Your Coconuts and Coconut. The lyrics of Shake Your Coconuts were changed to reference the Baker&#39;s Dozen. Reba&nbsp;did not have whistling. Walls of the Cave&nbsp;contained a Streets of Cairo&nbsp;tease by Trey. Mike teased Thread in Tweezer.</p>",
